  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen omfattar inneh&#xe5;llsproduktion f&#xf6;r sida.se som bidrar till m&#xe5;lomr&#xe5;de 1. Kunskap om svenskt utvecklingssamarbetes genomf&#xf6;rande och resultat, i strategin. Insatsen genomf&#xf6;rs l&#xf6;pande under &#xe5;ret. Fokus &#xe4;r l&#xe4;ttillg&#xe4;ngligt inneh&#xe5;ll med allm&#xe4;nheten som m&#xe5;lgrupp som f&#xf6;rklarar hur bist&#xe5;ndet fungerar, vad det finansierar och vilka resultat det uppn&#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution includes content production for the website sida.se that contributes to support area 1 of the INFOKOM strategy: Knowledge about the implementation and results of Swedish development cooperation. The contribution is implemented continuously during the year. The focus is on easily accessible content with the general public as the target group, explaining how development cooperation works, what it finances and what results it achieves.</narrative>
  </description>
